## Context

The author retains the comparison with regular pre-JETP energy projects, broadening outcomes beyond disbursement to preparation and financing speed. The old figure mixes political-pledge denominators with historical commitment denominators and cannot answer this question.

Plan: `conception/jetp-observatory-and-papers-plan.md`. Parent tracker: 0725.

## First test

First figure acceptance check: every JETP and historical mark uses the same defined transition and clock, with cohort size and missingness traceable to 0730. A pledge-normalised flow or partnership-age proxy must fail this check. A null or mixed difference must render and remain reportable.

## Actions

Rewrite conception/jetp-papier-court-mesure.md around the frozen analysis and produce the LaTeX manuscript in deliverables/jetp-mesure via 0711. Replace the old figure with supported stage comparisons; preserve it only as clearly labelled historical material if useful. Explain selection, pre-existing maturity and limits of historical causal inference. Do not make instrument substitution or a positive acceleration result an exit condition. If no duration comparison survives 0729/0730, record an explicit re-scope decision before drafting a different paper.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Question, methods and central figure use genuinely comparable lifecycle stages
- [ ] Manuscript reports supported findings including null/mixed outcomes
- [ ] Preparation bottlenecks distinguished from execution among approved projects
- [ ] Old disbursement-only and predetermined-mechanism claims reconciled
- [ ] Reproducible LaTeX manuscript with evidence-linked tables and limitations, ready for review

